    "canonical_ref": "tlg0533.tlg009.2.1.1",
    "language": "grc",
    "text": "Schol. Aristoph. Acharn. 127 Καλλίμαχος ἐν Ἑκάλῃ. Cf. Suid. s.v. Ἐκάλη, . . . ἔχε κτλ.,",
    "chunk_index": 10,
