  {
    "chunk_id": "first1k/tlg0533/tlg009/1st1K-grc1#tlg0533.tlg009.6.1.1",
    "work_id": "first1k/tlg0533/tlg009/1st1K-grc1",
    "canonical_ref": "tlg0533.tlg009.6.1.1",
    "language": "grc",
    "text": "Suid. s.v. μύωψ, . . . λέγεται παρὰ Καλλιμάχῳ ἐν Ἑκάλῃ· βοῦς σῶος (sic) μύωψ, ὁ τὰς βοῦς σοβῶν καὶ διώκων, but the whole line is quoted more or less correctly schol. Odyss. xii. 299 and elsewhere, where it is attributed to Callimachus.",
