    "canonical_ref": "tlg0533.tlg009.7.1.1",
    "language": "grc",
    "text": "Choerobosc. in Theodos. (Bekker, Anecd. p. 1399); cf. schol. Arat. 976, schol. Aristoph. Vesp. 262.",
