  {
    "chunk_id": "first1k/tlg0533/tlg009/1st1K-grc1#tlg0533.tlg009.10.1",
    "work_id": "first1k/tlg0533/tlg009/1st1K-grc1",
    "canonical_ref": "tlg0533.tlg009.10.1",
    "language": "grc",
    "text": "γεργέριμον πίτυρίν τε καὶ ἣν ἀπεθήκατο λευκὴν εἰν ἁλὶ νήχεσθαι φθινοπωρίδα.",
    "chunk_index": 25,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "post_schism": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "first1k/tlg0533/tlg009/1st1K-grc1#tlg0533.tlg009.10.1.1",
    "work_id": "first1k/tlg0533/tlg009/1st1K-grc1",
    "canonical_ref": "tlg0533.tlg009.10.1.1",
    "language": "grc",
    "text": "Athenaeus ii. 56 Καλλίμαχος δ’ ἐν τῇ Ἑκάλῃ γένη ἐλαῶν καταλέγει· γεργέριμον πίτυρίν τε. Suid. s.v. γεργέριμον, τὴν ἐν τῷ δένδρῳ πεπανθεῖσαν ἐλαίαν, πίτυρίν τε καὶ ἣν ἀπεθήκατο λευκήν, τουτέστι τὴν συνθλασθεῖσαν καὶ οὕτως ἀποτεθεῖσαν ἐλαίαν, εἰν ἁλὶ δὲ νήχεσθαι φθινοπωρίδα, τὴν κολυμβάδα λέγει. Cf. Nonnus xvii. 54 f. χύδην δ’ ἐπέβαλλε τραπέζῃ | εἰν ἁλὶ νηχομένης φθινοπωρίδος ἄνθος ἐλαίης Βρόγγος ἔχων μίμημα φιλοστόργοιο νομῆος [i.e. Molorcus who entertained Heracles].",
    "chunk_index": 26,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "post_schism": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "first1k/tlg0533/tlg009/1st1K-grc1#tlg0533.tlg009.11.1",
    "work_id": "first1k/tlg0533/tlg009/1st1K-grc1",
    "canonical_ref": "tlg0533.tlg009.11.1",
    "language": "grc",
    "text": "Plin. N. H. xxii. 88 Estur et sonchos — ut quem Theseo apud Callimachum adponat Hecale — uterque, albus uterque, et niger.",
    "chunk_index": 27,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "post_schism": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "first1k/tlg0533/tlg009/1st1K-grc1#tlg0533.tlg009.12.1",
    "work_id": "first1k/tlg0533/tlg009/1st1K-grc1",
    "canonical_ref": "tlg0533.tlg009.12.1",
    "language": "grc",
    "text": "Schol. Nicandr. Ther. 909 κρῆθμον· ἤτοι λάχανόν ἐστι. καὶ γὰρ μέμνηται αὐτοῦ καὶ Καλλίμαχος ἐν τῇ Ἑκάλῃ.",
    "chunk_index": 28,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "post_schism": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "first1k/tlg0533/tlg009/1st1K-grc1#tlg0533.tlg009.12.1.1",
    "work_id": "first1k/tlg0533/tlg009/1st1K-grc1",
    "canonical_ref": "tlg0533.tlg009.12.1.1",
    "language": "grc",
    "text": "Plin. N. H. xxvi. 82 eadem vis crethmo ab Hippocrate admodum laudato. est autem inter eas quae eduntur silvestrium herbarum. hanc certe apud Callimachum adponit rustica illa Hecale.",
    "chunk_index": 29,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "post_schism": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "first1k/tlg0533/tlg009/1st1K-grc1#tlg0533.tlg009.13.1",
    "work_id": "first1k/tlg0533/tlg009/1st1K-grc1",
    "canonical_ref": "tlg0533.tlg009.13.1",
    "language": "grc",
    "text": "δινομένην ὑπὸ βουσὶν ἐμὴν ἐφύλασσον ἅλωα.",
    "chunk_index": 30,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "post_schism": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "first1k/tlg0533/tlg009/1st1K-grc1#tlg0533.tlg009.13.1.1",
    "work_id": "first1k/tlg0533/tlg009/1st1K-grc1",
    "canonical_ref": "tlg0533.tlg009.13.1.1",
    "language": "grc",
    "text": "Suid. s.v. δεινουμένην. E.M. s.v. ἅλως. Cf. Cramer, Anecd. Ox. ii. p. 376, Bekker, Anecd. p. 1440, etc.",
    "chunk_index": 31,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "post_schism": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "first1k/tlg0533/tlg009/1st1K-grc1#tlg0533.tlg009.14.1",
    "work_id": "first1k/tlg0533/tlg009/1st1K-grc1",
    "canonical_ref": "tlg0533.tlg009.14.1",
    "language": "grc",
    "text": "ἡνίκα μὲν γὰρ ταὐτὰ φαείνεται ἀνθρώποισιν, αὐτοὶ μὲν φιλέουσ’, αὐτοὶ δέ τε πεφρίκασιν· ἑσπέριον φιλέουσιν, ἀτὰρ στυγέουσιν ἑῷον.",
    "chunk_index": 32,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "post_schism": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "first1k/tlg0533/tlg009/1st1K-grc1#tlg0533.tlg009.14.1.1",
    "work_id": "first1k/tlg0533/tlg009/1st1K-grc1",
    "canonical_ref": "tlg0533.tlg009.14.1.1",
    "language": "grc",
    "text": "Olympiodorus in Meteor. Aristot. p. 12 ὅτι γὰρ ὁ αὐτός ἐστι καὶ ἑῷος καὶ ἑσπέριος, δηλοῖ καὶ Καλλίμαχος λέγων ἐν Αἰκάλῃ [sic]· ἡνίκα μὲν γὰρ φαίνεται τοῖς ἀνθρώποις ταὐτά [corr. Hecker] . . ἀποστυγέουσιν ἑῷον. Eustath. Il. 1271. 35 ὡς καὶ Καλλιμάχῳ δοκεῖ ἔνθα φησὶν ὡς ἑσπέριον φιλέουσιν, ἀτὰρ στυγέουσιν ἑῷον. So the last line is given Tzetz. Chil. viii. 837, Ep. xliii.",
    "chunk_index": 33,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "post_schism": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "first1k/tlg0533/tlg009/1st1K-grc1#tlg0533.tlg009.15.1",
    "work_id": "first1k/tlg0533/tlg009/1st1K-grc1",
    "canonical_ref": "tlg0533.tlg009.15.1",
    "language": "grc",
    "text": "ἡ δ’ ἐκόησεν τοὔνεκεν Αἰγέος ἔσκε.",
    "chunk_index": 34,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "post_schism": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "first1k/tlg0533/tlg009/1st1K-grc1#tlg0533.tlg009.15.1.1",
    "work_id": "first1k/tlg0533/tlg009/1st1K-grc1",
    "canonical_ref": "tlg0533.tlg009.15.1.1",
    "language": "grc",
    "text": "Ammonius, De simil. et diff. voc. p. 139 Valck., E.M. s.v. κοάλεμον. Cf. Hellad. Phot. Bibl. p. 531. 13, Suid. s.v. ἐκόησεν.",
    "chunk_index": 35,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "post_schism": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "first1k/tlg0533/tlg009/1st1K-grc1#tlg0533.tlg009.16.1",
    "work_id": "first1k/tlg0533/tlg009/1st1K-grc1",
    "canonical_ref": "tlg0533.tlg009.16.1",
    "language": "grc",
    "text": "πολυπτῶκές τε Μέλαιναι.",
    "chunk_index": 36,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "post_schism": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "first1k/tlg0533/tlg009/1st1K-grc1#tlg0533.tlg009.16.1.1",
    "work_id": "first1k/tlg0533/tlg009/1st1K-grc1",
    "canonical_ref": "tlg0533.tlg009.16.1.1",
    "language": "grc",
    "text": "Etym. Gud. 300. 11 παρὰ Καλλιμάχῳ πολυ. κτλ. Steph. Byz. Μελαινεῖς, δῆμος τῆς Ἀντιοχίδος φυλῆς. Καλλίμαχος δὲ Μελαίνας φησὶ τὸν δῆμον ἐν Ἑκάλῃ.",
    "chunk_index": 37,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "post_schism": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "first1k/tlg0533/tlg009/1st1K-grc1#tlg0533.tlg009.17.1",
    "work_id": "first1k/tlg0533/tlg009/1st1K-grc1",
    "canonical_ref": "tlg0533.tlg009.17.1",
    "language": "grc",
    "text": "Steph. Byz. s.v. Τρινεμεῖς, δῆμος τῆς Κεκροπίδος φυλῆς. . . . Καλλίμαχος Ἑκάλῃ Τρινέμειαν.",
    "chunk_index": 38,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "post_schism": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "first1k/tlg0533/tlg009/1st1K-grc1#tlg0533.tlg009.18.1",
    "work_id": "first1k/tlg0533/tlg009/1st1K-grc1",
    "canonical_ref": "tlg0533.tlg009.18.1",
    "language": "grc",
    "text": "Hesych. s.v. γηφάγοι· πένητες, ἄποροι, ὡς τὰς ἐκ γῆς βοτάνας σιτιζόμενοι τροφῆς ἀμοιροῦντες. Καλλίμαχος ἐν Ἑκάλῃ.",
    "chunk_index": 39,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "post_schism": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "first1k/tlg0533/tlg009/1st1K-grc1#tlg0533.tlg009.19.1",
    "work_id": "first1k/tlg0533/tlg009/1st1K-grc1",
    "canonical_ref": "tlg0533.tlg009.19.1",
    "language": "grc",
    "text": "στάδιον δ’ ὑφέεστο χιτῶνα.",
    "chunk_index": 40,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "post_schism": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "first1k/tlg0533/tlg009/1st1K-grc1#tlg0533.tlg009.19.1.1",
    "work_id": "first1k/tlg0533/tlg009/1st1K-grc1",
    "canonical_ref": "tlg0533.tlg009.19.1.1",
    "language": "grc",
    "text": "Schol. Apoll. Rhod. iii. 1226 τινὲς δὲ στάδιον ὡς εὐπαγῆ, ὃν καὶ Καλλίμαχος λέγει· στάδιον κτλ. Suid. s.v. στάδιον· . . . καὶ στάδιος χιτών, ὁ ποδήρης, ὁ τέλειος, παρὰ Καλλιμάχῳ ἐν Ἑκάλῃ.",
    "chunk_index": 41,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "post_schism": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "first1k/tlg0533/tlg009/1st1K-grc1#tlg0533.tlg009.20.1",
    "work_id": "first1k/tlg0533/tlg009/1st1K-grc1",
    "canonical_ref": "tlg0533.tlg009.20.1",
    "language": "grc",
    "text": "ἐν μὲν γὰρ Τροιζῆνι κολουραίῃ ὑπὸ πέτρῃ θῆκε σὺν ἁρπίδεσσι.",
    "chunk_index": 42,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "post_schism": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "first1k/tlg0533/tlg009/1st1K-grc1#tlg0533.tlg009.20.1.1",
    "work_id": "first1k/tlg0533/tlg009/1st1K-grc1",
    "canonical_ref": "tlg0533.tlg009.20.1.1",
    "language": "grc",
    "text": "Tzetz. Lycophr. 494, cf. id. 1322. E.M. s.v. ἁρπίς. Suid. s.v. κολουραία πέτρα.",
    "chunk_index": 43,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "post_schism": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "first1k/tlg0533/tlg009/1st1K-grc1#tlg0533.tlg009.21.1",
    "work_id": "first1k/tlg0533/tlg009/1st1K-grc1",
    "canonical_ref": "tlg0533.tlg009.21.1",
    "language": "grc",
    "text": "εὖτ’ ἂν ὁ παῖς ἀπὸ μὲν γυαλὸν λίθον ἀγκάσσασθαι ἄρκιος ᾖ χείρεσσιν ἑλὼν Αἰδήψιον ἄορ.",
    "chunk_index": 44,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "post_schism": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "first1k/tlg0533/tlg009/1st1K-grc1#tlg0533.tlg009.22.1",
    "work_id": "first1k/tlg0533/tlg009/1st1K-grc1",
    "canonical_ref": "tlg0533.tlg009.22.1",
    "language": "grc",
    "text": "Λιμναίῳ δὲ χοροστάδας ἦγον ἑορτάς.",
    "chunk_index": 45,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "post_schism": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "first1k/tlg0533/tlg009/1st1K-grc1#tlg0533.tlg009.22.1.1",
    "work_id": "first1k/tlg0533/tlg009/1st1K-grc1",
    "canonical_ref": "tlg0533.tlg009.22.1.1",
    "language": "grc",
    "text": "Schol. Aristoph. Ran. 216. Cf. Steph. Byz. s.v. Λίμναι.",
    "chunk_index": 46,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "post_schism": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "first1k/tlg0533/tlg009/1st1K-grc1#tlg0533.tlg009.23.1",
    "work_id": "first1k/tlg0533/tlg009/1st1K-grc1",
    "canonical_ref": "tlg0533.tlg009.23.1",
    "language": "grc",
    "text": "τοῦτο γὰρ αὐτὴν κωμῆται κάλεον περιηγέες.1",
    "chunk_index": 47,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "post_schism": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "first1k/tlg0533/tlg009/1st1K-grc1#tlg0533.tlg009.23.1.1",
    "work_id": "first1k/tlg0533/tlg009/1st1K-grc1",
    "canonical_ref": "tlg0533.tlg009.23.1.1",
    "language": "grc",
    "text": "Suid. s.v. κωμῆται· καὶ οἱ γείτονες . . . Καλλίμαχος Ἑκάλῃ· τοῦτο κτλ.",
    "chunk_index": 48,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "post_schism": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "first1k/tlg0533/tlg009/1st1K-grc1#tlg0533.tlg009.24.1",
    "work_id": "first1k/tlg0533/tlg009/1st1K-grc1",
    "canonical_ref": "tlg0533.tlg009.24.1",
    "language": "grc",
    "text": "παλαίθετα κᾶλα καθῄρει.",
    "chunk_index": 49,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "post_schism": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "first1k/tlg0533/tlg009/1st1K-grc1#tlg0533.tlg009.24.1.1",
    "work_id": "first1k/tlg0533/tlg009/1st1K-grc1",
    "canonical_ref": "tlg0533.tlg009.24.1.1",
    "language": "grc",
    "text": "Etym. Paris. 2720 (Cramer, Anec. Par. iv. 53) Καλλίμαχος Ἑκάλῃ· παλαίθετα κτλ. Cf. Suid. s.v. κᾶλα παλαίθετα.",
    "chunk_index": 50,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "post_schism": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "first1k/tlg0533/tlg009/1st1K-grc1#tlg0533.tlg009.25.1",
    "work_id": "first1k/tlg0533/tlg009/1st1K-grc1",
    "canonical_ref": "tlg0533.tlg009.25.1",
    "language": "grc",
    "text": "ναὶ μὰ τόν.",
    "chunk_index": 51,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "post_schism": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "first1k/tlg0533/tlg009/1st1K-grc1#tlg0533.tlg009.25.1.1",
    "work_id": "first1k/tlg0533/tlg009/1st1K-grc1",
    "canonical_ref": "tlg0533.tlg009.25.1.1",
    "language": "grc",
    "text": "Suid. s.v. ναὶ μὰ τό· . . . καὶ Ἑκάλη εἶπε ναὶ μὰ τόν καὶ οὐκέτι ἐπάγει τὸν θεόν, ῥυθμίζει δὲ ὁ λόγος πρὸς εὐσέβειαν.",
    "chunk_index": 52,
    "context_before": null,
