  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "first1k/tlg0533/tlg009/1st1K-grc1#tlg0533.tlg009.26.1",
    "work_id": "first1k/tlg0533/tlg009/1st1K-grc1",
    "canonical_ref": "tlg0533.tlg009.26.1",
    "language": "grc",
    "text": "οὐ γάρ μοι πενίη πατρώϊος, οὐδ’ ἀπὸ πάππων εἰμὶ λιπερνῆτις· βάλε μοι, βάλε τὸ τρίτον εἴη.",
    "chunk_index": 53,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "post_schism": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "first1k/tlg0533/tlg009/1st1K-grc1#tlg0533.tlg009.26.1.1",
    "work_id": "first1k/tlg0533/tlg009/1st1K-grc1",
    "canonical_ref": "tlg0533.tlg009.26.1.1",
    "language": "grc",
    "text": "E.M. s.v. λιπερνῆτις (cod. Vossianus Gaisford). Et. Flor. p. 207 Müller. Schol. Dion. Thrac. p. 946. 15 βάλε μοι . . . εἴη, Καλλίμαχος.",
    "chunk_index": 54,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "post_schism": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "first1k/tlg0533/tlg009/1st1K-grc1#tlg0533.tlg009.27.1",
    "work_id": "first1k/tlg0533/tlg009/1st1K-grc1",
    "canonical_ref": "tlg0533.tlg009.27.1",
    "language": "grc",
    "text": "Schol. Eurip. Hippol. 32 πέτραν δὲ Παλλάδος φησὶ τὸ ἐν τῇ Ἀττικῇ Γλαυκώπιον, οὗ Καλλίμαχος ἐν Ἑκάλῃ μέμνηται.",
    "chunk_index": 55,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "post_schism": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "first1k/tlg0533/tlg009/1st1K-grc1#tlg0533.tlg009.28.1",
    "work_id": "first1k/tlg0533/tlg009/1st1K-grc1",
    "canonical_ref": "tlg0533.tlg009.28.1",
    "language": "grc",
    "text": "Suid. s.v. Κωλιάς· ναός ἐστι τῆς Ἀφροδίτης οὕτω καλούμενος. . . . μέμνηται καὶ Καλλίμαχος ἐν Ἑκάλῃ.",
    "chunk_index": 56,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "post_schism": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "first1k/tlg0533/tlg009/1st1K-grc1#tlg0533.tlg009.29.1",
    "work_id": "first1k/tlg0533/tlg009/1st1K-grc1",
    "canonical_ref": "tlg0533.tlg009.29.1",
    "language": "grc",
    "text": "Schol. Euseb. Praep. Evang. iv. 16 οὐ τὴν πρὸς ταῖς Ἀθήναις Σαλαμῖνα λέγει. αὕτη γὰρ Κούλουρις πάλαι ἐλέγετο, ὡς καὶ Καλλίμαχος ἐν Ἑκάλῃ φησίν, ἀλλὰ τὴν κατὰ Κύπρον Σαλαμῖνα λέγει.",
    "chunk_index": 57,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "post_schism": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "first1k/tlg0533/tlg009/1st1K-grc1#tlg0533.tlg009.30.1",
    "work_id": "first1k/tlg0533/tlg009/1st1K-grc1",
    "canonical_ref": "tlg0533.tlg009.30.1",
    "language": "grc",
    "text": "ἴθι, πρηεῖα γυναικῶν, τὴν ὁδὸν ἣν ἀνίαι θυμαλγέες οὐ περόωσιν. πολλάκι σεῖο 〈δέ〉,1 μαῖα, φιλοξείνοιο καλιῆς μνησόμεθα· ξυνὸν γὰρ ἐπαύλιον ἔσκεν ἅπασιν.",
    "chunk_index": 58,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "post_schism": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "first1k/tlg0533/tlg009/1st1K-grc1#tlg0533.tlg009.30.1.1",
    "work_id": "first1k/tlg0533/tlg009/1st1K-grc1",
    "canonical_ref": "tlg0533.tlg009.30.1.1",
    "language": "grc",
    "text": "Suid. s.v. ἐπαύλιον δὲ μονή. περὶ Ἑκάλης θανούσης· ἴθι κτλ. Cf E.M. s.v. θάνατος. . . . ἴθι . . . περόωσι, Καλλίμαχος.",
    "chunk_index": 59,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "post_schism": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "first1k/tlg0533/tlg009/1st1K-grc1#tlg0533.tlg009.31.1",
    "work_id": "first1k/tlg0533/tlg009/1st1K-grc1",
    "canonical_ref": "tlg0533.tlg009.31.1",
    "language": "grc",
    "text": "τοὔνεκα καὶ νέκυες πορθμήϊον οὔ τι φέρονται μούνῃ ἔνι πτολίων, ὅ τε τέθμιον οἰσέμεν ἄλλους ἐν στομάτεσσι νεὼς Ἀχεροντείας2 ἐπίβαθρον (δανάκην).",
    "chunk_index": 60,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "post_schism": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "first1k/tlg0533/tlg009/1st1K-grc1#tlg0533.tlg009.31.1.1",
    "work_id": "first1k/tlg0533/tlg009/1st1K-grc1",
    "canonical_ref": "tlg0533.tlg009.31.1.1",
    "language": "grc",
    "text": "E.M. s.v. δανάκης νομίσματός ἐστιν ὄνομα βαρβαρικόν, πλέον ὀβολοῦ, ὃ τοῖς νεκροῖς ἐν τοῖς στόμασιν ἐτίθεσαν· Καλλίμαχος· τοὔνεκα κτλ. Cf. Suid. s.v. πορθμήϊον, ὁ μισθὸς τοῦ ναύτου. Καλλίμαχος· τοὔνεκα . . . φέρονται. ἐν Αἰγιαλῷ γὰρ καταβάσιόν ἐστιν Ἅιδου, εἰς ὃ ἀπελθοῦσα ἡ Δημήτηρ ἔμαθε παρὰ τῶν περιοἰκων περὶ τῆς κόρης. καὶ ἐδωρήσατο αὐτοῖς, ὡς λέγει, ἄφεσιν τοῦ πορθμηΐου. Cf. Suid. s.vv. Ἀχερουσία and δανάκη, Pollux ix. 6.",
    "chunk_index": 61,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "post_schism": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "first1k/tlg0533/tlg009/1st1K-grc1#tlg0533.tlg009.32.1",
    "work_id": "first1k/tlg0533/tlg009/1st1K-grc1",
    "canonical_ref": "tlg0533.tlg009.32.1",
    "language": "grc",
    "text": "ἀλλὰ θεῆς, ἥτις με διάκτορον ἔλλαχε Παλλάς.",
    "chunk_index": 62,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "post_schism": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "first1k/tlg0533/tlg009/1st1K-grc1#tlg0533.tlg009.32.1.1",
    "work_id": "first1k/tlg0533/tlg009/1st1K-grc1",
    "canonical_ref": "tlg0533.tlg009.32.1.1",
    "language": "grc",
    "text": "E.M. s.v. διάκτορος· . . . τοῦ γὰρ Ἑρμοῦ ἐπίθετον· παρὰ δὲ τοῖς ἄλλοις ποιηταῖς ἁπλῶς ἐπὶ τοῦ διακόνου τίθεται. Καλλίμαχος ἐπὶ γλαυκὸς τὸ ἐπίθετον· ἀλλὰ θεῆς κτλ.",
    "chunk_index": 63,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "post_schism": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "first1k/tlg0533/tlg009/1st1K-grc1#tlg0533.tlg009.33.1",
    "work_id": "first1k/tlg0533/tlg009/1st1K-grc1",
    "canonical_ref": "tlg0533.tlg009.33.1",
    "language": "grc",
    "text": "ὁ μὲν εἷλκεν, ὁ δ’ εἵπετο νωθρὸς ὁδίτης.",
    "chunk_index": 64,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "post_schism": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "first1k/tlg0533/tlg009/1st1K-grc1#tlg0533.tlg009.33.1.1",
    "work_id": "first1k/tlg0533/tlg009/1st1K-grc1",
    "canonical_ref": "tlg0533.tlg009.33.1.1",
    "language": "grc",
    "text": "Schol. Apoll. Rhod. i. 1162 καὶ Καλλίμαχος ἐπὶ τοῦ ταύρου ἡττηθέντος φησίν· ὁ μὲν κτλ.",
    "chunk_index": 65,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "post_schism": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "first1k/tlg0533/tlg009/1st1K-grc1#tlg0533.tlg009.34.1",
    "work_id": "first1k/tlg0533/tlg009/1st1K-grc1",
    "canonical_ref": "tlg0533.tlg009.34.1",
    "language": "grc",
    "text": "πέδιλα, τὰ μὴ πύσε νήχυτος εὐρώς.",
    "chunk_index": 66,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "post_schism": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "first1k/tlg0533/tlg009/1st1K-grc1#tlg0533.tlg009.34.1.1",
    "work_id": "first1k/tlg0533/tlg009/1st1K-grc1",
    "canonical_ref": "tlg0533.tlg009.34.1.1",
    "language": "grc",
    "text": "Suid. s.v. εὐρώς· ὑγρότης σεσηπυῖα. Καλλίμαχος πέδιλα κτλ. Cf. id. s.v. νήχυτος ἔρως [sic].",
    "chunk_index": 67,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "post_schism": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "first1k/tlg0533/tlg009/1st1K-grc1#tlg0533.tlg009.35.1",
    "work_id": "first1k/tlg0533/tlg009/1st1K-grc1",
    "canonical_ref": "tlg0533.tlg009.35.1",
    "language": "grc",
    "text": "ἐκ δ’ ἄρτους σιπύηθεν ἅλις κατέθηκεν ἑλοῦσα.",
    "chunk_index": 68,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "post_schism": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "first1k/tlg0533/tlg009/1st1K-grc1#tlg0533.tlg009.35.1.1",
    "work_id": "first1k/tlg0533/tlg009/1st1K-grc1",
    "canonical_ref": "tlg0533.tlg009.35.1.1",
    "language": "grc",
    "text": "Zonaras, p. 1645 σιπύη· τὸ κανίσκιον ἢ ἡ ἀρτοθήκη. Καλλίμαχος· ἐκ δ’ ἄρτους κτλ. Cf. Apoll. Dysc. De adverb. p. 605. 6.",
